5. Simple Explanation (Exam Ready)
forRoot() → application-level configuration
forFeature() → feature-level configuration

6. One-Line Definitions
forRoot: Initializes and configures a module globally.
forFeature: Registers providers for a specific feature module.

Interview Tip
Use forRoot() for setup and forFeature() for usage.


